1
00:00:00,813 --> 00:00:04,490
A maker can sell an entire batch and barely
cover the cost.

2
00:00:05,332 --> 00:00:08,634
A missing hour of work or a package can change
the numbers.

3
00:00:09,465 --> 00:00:12,667
Finansi makes the cost visible before the
first sale.

4
00:00:14,681 --> 00:00:17,356
Here's a new workshop in the Spanish-language
app.

5
00:00:18,195 --> 00:00:21,848
I'll price a batch of two handmade candles in
Peruvian soles.

6
00:00:23,832 --> 00:00:26,910
I use five hundred grams from a kilogram of
wax.

7
00:00:27,716 --> 00:00:31,948
The kilogram costs twenty-four soles. The wax
I use costs twelve.

8
00:00:32,814 --> 00:00:35,268
Jars and wicks add eight soles to the batch.

9
00:00:39,831 --> 00:00:43,666
One hour of work adds fifteen soles, and
packaging adds five.

10
00:00:44,499 --> 00:00:46,153
The batch costs forty soles.

11
00:00:46,953 --> 00:00:48,647
That's twenty soles per candle.

12
00:00:52,832 --> 00:00:55,131
I set a target margin of twenty percent.

13
00:00:55,947 --> 00:00:59,961
Finansi recommends twenty-five soles, leaving
five per candle.

14
00:01:02,829 --> 00:01:06,940
At eighteen soles, Finansi warns me that each
sale would lose money.

15
00:01:07,814 --> 00:01:11,263
Now I compare twenty-five and thirty soles for
three sales.

16
00:01:12,117 --> 00:01:17,066
Estimated profit is fifteen soles at the first
price and thirty at the second.

17
00:01:19,830 --> 00:01:22,797
I choose the thirty-sol price and save the
product.

18
00:01:23,652 --> 00:01:28,023
After a reload, the catalog still has my
recipe and chosen price.

19
00:01:28,872 --> 00:01:31,349
I can open the recipe again in this browser.

20
00:01:33,350 --> 00:01:37,863
I change the price of a kilogram of wax from
twenty-four to twenty-eight soles.

21
00:01:38,713 --> 00:01:42,438
The batch now costs forty-two soles, or
twenty-one per candle.

22
00:01:43,283 --> 00:01:48,437
Finansi updates the recommended price to
twenty-six soles and twenty-five cents.

23
00:01:51,352 --> 00:01:55,541
I keep the thirty-sol price and record a demo
sale of two candles.

24
00:01:56,394 --> 00:02:01,028
I can see sixty soles to collect and eighteen
in estimated gross profit.

25
00:02:05,344 --> 00:02:10,454
JavaScript calculates each price, and
IndexedDB saves the work in your browser.

26
00:02:11,295 --> 00:02:13,418
Try Finansi with something you make.

27
00:02:14,272 --> 00:02:17,100
Before the first sale, know what every unit
costs.
